          "context": "_ga=2.154024123.2058216465.1599409801-1261549759.1594155977\n Evidence 1: Did Sen. Martha McSally support a plan to raise the retirement age?  Yes\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-b7039c2b13f6::sentence-7",
          "documentId": "doc-b7039c2b13f6",
          "text": "Evidence 2: Did Sen. Martha McSally support a plan to raise the retirement age? ",
          "start": 392,
